### =========================
### AUTORES
### =========================

### 1. Crear autor
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "nationality": "Colombiana",
  "birthYear": 1927
}


### 2. Obtener todos los autores
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/authors


### 3. Obtener autor por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/authors/6abbed7b6e4d6a363d26a069


### 4. Actualizar autor
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/authors/6abbed7b6e4d6a363d26a069
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationality": "Colombiana"
}


### 5. Eliminar autor
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/authors/6abbed7b6e4d6a363d26a069

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### =========================
### LIBROS
### =========================

### 1. Crear libro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cien años de soledad",
  "isbn": "9780307474728",
  "authorId": "6abbed7b6e4d6a363d26a069",
  "year": 1967
}


### 2. Obtener todos los libros
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/books

---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### =========================
### PRÉSTAMOS
### =========================

### 1. Crear préstamo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "6abc31081b6a43182243ef08",
  "userName": "Daniela",
  "loanDate": "2026-09-29"
}

### Devolver préstamo
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/loans/6abc35535b9a61d3805f3a0f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returned": true
}

### Crear nuevo préstamo después de devolución
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "6abc31081b6a43182243ef08",
  "userName": "Daniela",
  "loanDate": "2026-09-29"
}